WEBVTT

00:01.501 --> 00:03.753
After setting out to establish a route
to Shiganshina,

00:03.837 --> 00:08.925
the Scout Regiment encountered
the intelligent Female Titan

00:17.058 --> 00:19.227
As soldier after soldier fell,

00:19.936 --> 00:22.939
the Regiment rushed
into a forest of giant trees,

00:23.231 --> 00:25.608
much to everyone's puzzlement.

00:25.942 --> 00:29.487
Who could possibly stop it,
if not Squad Levi?

00:31.740 --> 00:32.949
Another one is dead!

00:33.658 --> 00:35.744
We could have saved him too!

00:37.078 --> 00:37.912
Choose.

00:38.621 --> 00:39.914
Will you trust yourself,

00:40.623 --> 00:44.169
or me, these guys,
and the entire Scout Regiment?

00:47.005 --> 00:48.381
I'll go with you!

00:55.013 --> 00:56.890
Fire!

01:05.065 --> 01:06.024
You don't mean...

01:06.816 --> 01:09.486
They are going to take that Titan alive?

01:10.153 --> 01:13.948
What do you think of that, Eren?
We caught that Titan!

01:14.032 --> 01:18.161
This is the might of Scout Regiment!
Don't underestimate us, you idiot!

01:18.244 --> 01:19.746
Now do you see?

01:21.289 --> 01:22.248
Yes!

01:25.543 --> 01:27.462
It looks like she's been restrained.

01:28.171 --> 01:29.547
We can't drop our guard yet.

01:30.215 --> 01:33.676
I'm just impressed you managed
to lead her to this spot.

01:34.427 --> 01:37.597
The credit goes to the rear squad,
who gave their lives fighting her.

01:37.931 --> 01:39.140
They bought us time.

01:40.308 --> 01:42.143
It would've been impossible otherwise.

01:42.811 --> 01:43.812
Is that so?

01:44.229 --> 01:45.271
Yes.

01:46.689 --> 01:48.358
Thanks to them

01:48.650 --> 01:51.361
we get to see
who's inside this one's nape.

01:52.946 --> 01:55.865
Let's just hope they are not
wetting themselves inside there.

03:42.847 --> 03:44.057
An Abnormal?

03:44.182 --> 03:47.101
Or is it like the Colossal Titan?

03:48.978 --> 03:50.730
Wait. Did Commander Erwin actually--

03:50.813 --> 03:53.149
Hey! Quit spacing out!

03:53.233 --> 03:54.192
Eren!

03:54.275 --> 03:57.487
You can think later!
We need to get further ahead!

03:57.987 --> 03:58.905
Right!

04:05.119 --> 04:06.204
Wait, Levi.

04:06.996 --> 04:08.164
We need to be extra cautious.

04:08.915 --> 04:10.083
Waves two and three!

04:10.416 --> 04:11.709
Fire!

04:12.335 --> 04:14.212
Use the reserves too!

04:32.563 --> 04:34.816
They are starting to climb up.

04:35.108 --> 04:36.109
Indeed.

04:36.442 --> 04:39.696
If they make it up this far,
perhaps I'll step out of the way.

04:40.446 --> 04:45.618
Although, I suspect we'll soon
be given orders to withdraw anyway.

04:45.702 --> 04:50.581
Does it have something to do
with those explosions inside the forest?

04:50.665 --> 04:51.791
I don't know.

04:54.877 --> 04:55.878
Mikasa.

04:56.379 --> 04:58.256
What do you think those sounds are?

04:58.631 --> 05:01.175
Are cannons being fired inside the forest?

05:04.637 --> 05:07.598
I didn't see them bring in
any cannons though.

05:08.224 --> 05:10.226
What's with all this damn noise?

05:10.852 --> 05:12.145
Hey, Bertholdt.

05:12.437 --> 05:14.564
Do you know which way Christa went?

05:14.814 --> 05:16.649
Sorry. I don't.

05:17.066 --> 05:19.110
Nothing makes sense anymore.

05:19.569 --> 05:21.612
What are we even doing now, and why?

05:21.821 --> 05:23.072
I want to go home.

05:26.117 --> 05:28.202
- Let's move away, Armin!
- Right!

05:35.877 --> 05:38.087
Looks like the bastard
has gotten the hang of it.

05:38.546 --> 05:40.965
It's gotten better and better
at tree-climbing!

05:41.174 --> 05:44.427
The scary thing is that
this means they can learn.

05:44.719 --> 05:46.721
Although, I'm sure it's different
for each Titan too.

05:47.346 --> 05:48.306
Armin.

05:48.848 --> 05:51.184
They seem to be up to something
inside the forest,

05:51.601 --> 05:53.603
and I think I've figured out what it is.

05:54.604 --> 05:57.065
They lured that Female Titan here

05:57.315 --> 05:58.900
to capture her.

06:00.485 --> 06:01.861
Or more precisely,

06:02.653 --> 06:05.156
to capture the human inside.

06:06.282 --> 06:07.825
That was Commander Erwin's goal...

06:09.535 --> 06:11.120
...from the very start,

06:11.496 --> 06:13.122
wasn't it?

06:13.623 --> 06:18.586
Still, I can understand keeping it
from us rookies, but you guys too?

06:18.669 --> 06:20.755
You've been Scouts for a long time!

06:20.838 --> 06:22.131
Man, you're annoying!

06:22.215 --> 06:26.219
Are you suggesting the Commander
and the Captain don't trust us?

06:26.302 --> 06:29.555
No, but that's what this means,
doesn't it?

06:29.889 --> 06:32.100
Petra! Knock out his teeth!

06:32.183 --> 06:33.810
Switch his front teeth with his back ones!

06:33.893 --> 06:34.769
No.

06:34.852 --> 06:36.729
- Eren is right.
- What?

06:36.813 --> 06:41.150
The Commander must have had a reason
for not trusting us.

06:42.068 --> 06:43.027
Like what?

06:43.236 --> 06:46.072
There's only one reason
he couldn't trust his comrades.

06:46.739 --> 06:50.118
There's someone in the regiment
who can either turn into a Titan

06:50.201 --> 06:53.037
or is working as a sort of spy for them.

06:54.288 --> 06:56.082
You think so too, right?

06:56.958 --> 06:58.376
That there is someone in the regiment.

06:58.459 --> 06:59.418
Yes.

06:59.919 --> 07:01.129
I think there is.

07:06.342 --> 07:07.593
A spy?

07:08.136 --> 07:09.470
Are you really sure?

07:10.054 --> 07:13.141
At the very least,
the Commander must believe so.

07:13.558 --> 07:16.394
I assume the only soldiers informed
of this operation

07:16.644 --> 07:18.980
were the ones who survived five years ago.

07:19.063 --> 07:20.106
I see.

07:20.189 --> 07:21.315
So that's why.

07:21.399 --> 07:23.234
Yes, that has to be it.

07:23.484 --> 07:25.903
Do you get it, Eren?
That's what's going on.

07:26.154 --> 07:28.698
Yes. In that case, it couldn't be helped.

07:28.781 --> 07:29.907
Yes.

07:29.991 --> 07:33.536
It was five years ago
when the Wall was first broken.

07:33.786 --> 07:35.830
Could they be using that fact
to narrow down suspects

07:36.330 --> 07:38.332
on the assumption
that's when the spy got inside?

07:39.167 --> 07:42.879
Does that mean this person killed
Sawney and Beane too?

07:44.005 --> 07:48.134
The Commander asked me something
after that happened.

07:50.636 --> 07:52.221
What do you see here?

07:53.181 --> 07:54.849
What do you think the enemy is?

07:55.600 --> 07:57.935
Is that what that meant?

07:58.144 --> 08:00.146
We might have been allowed
to join the operation

08:00.229 --> 08:03.107
if we had known the answer
to that question.

08:04.025 --> 08:06.152
I doubt any of us could have though.

08:06.235 --> 08:08.237
Well, I knew.

08:08.321 --> 08:13.784
But I decided not to say anything.
Do you guys know why?

08:14.285 --> 08:15.286
Why?

08:16.162 --> 08:18.247
What? You mean, you don't know?

08:18.748 --> 08:21.501
I guess guys like you wouldn't know.

08:21.667 --> 08:25.004
You're nowhere near
my level yet after all.

08:25.087 --> 08:28.341
Seriously, are you still trying
to imitate Captain Levi?

08:28.508 --> 08:30.301
He doesn't talk like that.

08:30.384 --> 08:34.597
If this succeeds, we might actually learn
the truth about this world.

08:35.348 --> 08:37.934
Still, even for that,

08:39.352 --> 08:41.854
way too many people have died.

08:45.983 --> 08:48.277
Do you think the Commander
was wrong to do this?

08:52.323 --> 08:54.116
He wasn't in the right,
I'll tell you that.

08:54.534 --> 08:58.037
If we had actually been told
that one of us could turn into a Titan,

08:58.496 --> 09:00.373
we would have handled things differently.

09:01.123 --> 09:03.292
Your own squad members, for example.

09:08.089 --> 09:10.800
- No, it wasn't wrong.
- What?

09:11.092 --> 09:12.593
How could you say that?

09:13.010 --> 09:15.555
Do you know how many soldiers
have needlessly died?

09:16.430 --> 09:17.390
Jean.

09:17.640 --> 09:20.518
In hindsight, it's easy to say
what should have been done.

09:20.977 --> 09:24.730
But no one can tell
how things will turn out.

09:25.147 --> 09:29.360
Yet, at some point,
you have to make a choice.

09:30.528 --> 09:32.196
The lives of a hundred comrades

09:32.613 --> 09:34.657
or the lives of everyone inside the Walls.

09:35.575 --> 09:37.076
The Commander chose only one.

09:37.743 --> 09:41.497
He chose to throw away the lives
of a hundred comrades.

09:41.914 --> 09:42.873
Eren.

09:43.374 --> 09:46.961
If you haven't realized it yet,
you'll soon learn why

09:47.545 --> 09:51.340
Erwin Smith was put in charge
of the Scout Regiment,

09:51.424 --> 09:53.301
the humanity's hope.

09:53.718 --> 09:56.679
That's why even Captain Levi's trusts him!

09:56.762 --> 10:00.266
That's assuming you survive
long enough, of course.

10:01.559 --> 10:03.561
I don't have much life experience yet,

10:04.061 --> 10:05.771
but I do know one thing.

10:06.480 --> 10:09.483
If there's anyone
who can bring about change,

10:09.775 --> 10:13.571
it's someone capable of giving up
what matters most.

10:14.572 --> 10:18.451
In particular, people who are capable
of abandoning their humanity

10:18.534 --> 10:20.786
when forced to rise above monsters.

10:22.038 --> 10:24.332
Those who can't abandon anything

10:24.832 --> 10:27.084
can't change anything.

10:29.587 --> 10:31.213
Fire!

10:35.343 --> 10:36.510
How do you like that?

10:36.927 --> 10:41.098
Now you can't scratch a single itch
or move a single muscle.

10:41.182 --> 10:42.683
And you probably never will again.

10:43.976 --> 10:49.273
The more your wounds heal,
the stiffer your joints will get!

10:52.318 --> 10:55.613
Still, why haven't they extracted
our esteemed guest yet?

10:56.072 --> 10:59.116
What are Levi and Miche doing?

11:24.100 --> 11:29.146
So she has the ability to cover portions
of her body with hardened skin?

11:29.647 --> 11:32.775
Much like the Armored Titan
I've heard about.

11:34.443 --> 11:38.614
Will it weaken if we continue
an omnidirectional mobility sword assault?

11:39.907 --> 11:41.617
There's no time to try.

11:41.784 --> 11:42.868
In which case...

11:44.620 --> 11:45.496
Sir!

11:45.704 --> 11:46.705
Prepare to blast it.

11:47.665 --> 11:49.208
Blow off the target's hands.

11:49.375 --> 11:50.251
Yes, sir!

11:50.751 --> 11:53.671
However, there's a risk
our standard artillery

11:54.296 --> 11:57.007
could take out everything
on the inside as well.

11:57.216 --> 12:00.845
Then let's attempt to sever
the wrists instead.

12:02.096 --> 12:04.265
Fire an all-out salvo on my signal.

12:04.348 --> 12:05.182
Understood!

12:14.900 --> 12:15.860
Hey.

12:16.318 --> 12:18.404
Just come out already, will you?

12:19.113 --> 12:21.657
We don't have time for this.

12:22.450 --> 12:25.536
Say, what do you think
is going to happen to you now?

12:26.412 --> 12:30.499
Do you really think
you can get out of this situation?

12:31.834 --> 12:35.045
I wish you'd think about
the problems you've caused.

12:36.172 --> 12:40.426
You killed our men in all sorts of ways.

12:40.926 --> 12:43.012
Was it fun?

12:44.430 --> 12:46.265
Well, I'm having fun now.

12:46.765 --> 12:49.185
I take it you're the same way.

12:50.436 --> 12:53.772
If there's anyone
who knows how I feel, it's you.

12:56.192 --> 12:57.234
Oh, right.

12:57.902 --> 12:59.778
There's one thing I need to ask.

13:01.197 --> 13:04.158
Will you be fine
if your limbs get cut off?

13:05.075 --> 13:06.785
They will grow back, right?

13:07.536 --> 13:09.872
I'm talking about your actual body.

13:10.831 --> 13:14.376
We can't afford
to have you die on us after all.

13:46.116 --> 13:47.368
Damn.

13:47.451 --> 13:49.036
You startled me there.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.123
Were those her death throes?

13:56.544 --> 13:57.920
Erwin, I smell them.

13:58.295 --> 13:59.129
In which direction?

13:59.505 --> 14:01.799
In all directions, all at once!
Lots of them!

14:07.012 --> 14:08.180
What the...

14:08.264 --> 14:09.848
They are rushing into the forest
all at once!

14:10.349 --> 14:12.017
Why are they suddenly ignoring us?

14:16.814 --> 14:17.731
What?

14:18.232 --> 14:20.860
Does this mean they are all Abnormals?

14:20.943 --> 14:23.279
It doesn't matter! Don't let them through!

14:23.863 --> 14:25.656
Commence combat!

14:28.158 --> 14:29.618
What was that all of a sudden?

14:29.910 --> 14:30.911
Please, wait!

14:32.621 --> 14:35.207
I've heard screams like that before!

14:35.541 --> 14:37.209
In the forest where I'm from!

14:37.543 --> 14:40.963
It's the sound a cornered animal makes
when it's ready to give up everything!

14:41.297 --> 14:45.009
I was taught that the end of a hunt
is when you have to be most careful!

14:45.593 --> 14:47.469
So you want me to be careful?

14:47.678 --> 14:49.763
Please be a hundred times
more careful than normal!

14:49.847 --> 14:51.891
You will die
if you don't take the forest seriously!

14:52.558 --> 14:54.768
I'm from the mountains too, actually.

14:55.102 --> 14:57.479
You're a vegetable farmer!
You wouldn't understand!

14:57.646 --> 14:58.689
I see.

14:59.648 --> 15:02.443
Sasha's hunches are often right.

15:03.027 --> 15:06.030
And it's usually only
before something bad happens.

15:07.072 --> 15:11.035
Armin said Eren might be at the rear
of the center rank, as I recall.

15:17.207 --> 15:18.751
Hurry with artillery!

15:19.627 --> 15:20.502
Erwin!

15:20.586 --> 15:22.880
The first wave is coming from the east!
They are close!

15:24.882 --> 15:27.092
Cart guard team! Intercept them!

15:34.016 --> 15:36.185
They are ignoring us? Are they Abnormals?

15:37.227 --> 15:38.604
Three Titans have broken through!

15:39.730 --> 15:40.940
Captain Levi!

15:41.231 --> 15:42.566
Hey, you.

15:42.816 --> 15:44.944
You just did something, didn't you?

15:55.913 --> 15:57.957
It went directly to the Female Titan?

16:00.459 --> 16:03.253
Titans coming from all directions!

16:03.837 --> 16:05.506
All soldiers, commence combat!

16:06.298 --> 16:08.550
Defend the Female Titan at all costs!

16:24.608 --> 16:25.526
No!

16:39.331 --> 16:41.041
All soldiers, withdraw!

16:43.085 --> 16:44.795
Redeploy the formation!

16:46.005 --> 16:47.881
Return to Calaneth District!

17:06.400 --> 17:07.568
We've been bested.

17:09.236 --> 17:13.073
What's with that pathetic look of yours?

17:13.157 --> 17:17.870
This goes to show that the enemy
was prepared to throw away everything.

17:19.246 --> 17:22.541
I never imagined our target would resort
to Titan cannibalization

17:22.624 --> 17:24.418
to dispose of information.

17:26.420 --> 17:28.964
After all that blustering we did
in the courtroom,

17:29.048 --> 17:30.299
this is how it turns out.

17:30.632 --> 17:32.426
If we waltz back there now,

17:32.718 --> 17:34.636
who knows what will happen to Eren or us?

17:35.387 --> 17:37.014
We can think about that
once we've returned.

17:37.723 --> 17:41.518
For now, we need to focus on returning
without sustaining any further losses.

17:42.436 --> 17:43.520
For now.

17:45.481 --> 17:47.566
The steam is impairing visibility.

17:48.233 --> 17:50.652
It could hinder
smoke signal communications.

17:56.867 --> 17:58.243
I'm going to get my squad.

17:59.036 --> 17:59.995
Wait, Levi.

18:00.996 --> 18:02.664
Replenish your gas and blades first.

18:03.207 --> 18:06.168
We're low on time
and I have enough to last already.

18:06.251 --> 18:07.169
Why?

18:07.628 --> 18:08.712
That's an order.

18:09.129 --> 18:10.214
Do as you're told.

18:11.381 --> 18:13.092
Whatever you say, Erwin.

18:14.593 --> 18:16.386
I'll trust your judgment.

18:30.359 --> 18:31.318
The withdrawal signal.

18:31.860 --> 18:35.030
We're all to withdraw
and return to base on horseback.

18:35.114 --> 18:35.948
Right!

18:36.490 --> 18:37.366
What?

18:37.699 --> 18:38.951
Is it all over?

18:42.162 --> 18:44.081
All right! We can go home!

18:45.290 --> 18:46.750
Just what is going on?

18:47.584 --> 18:48.627
Is Eren all right?

18:50.420 --> 18:52.047
Looks like it's over.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.967
Let's get back to the horses!
Prepare to withdraw!

18:55.551 --> 18:56.635
You heard the man.

18:56.718 --> 19:01.181
Let's go see what the bastard
riding inside it looks like.

19:03.559 --> 19:05.644
Did they really find out who it was?

19:05.853 --> 19:07.229
All thanks to you!

19:07.855 --> 19:09.231
What? But I didn't do anything.

19:09.690 --> 19:11.650
You trusted us, remember?

19:12.317 --> 19:16.113
Things turned out this way
because you chose to stick with us.

19:16.488 --> 19:19.992
Making the right call
is a pretty hard thing to do, you know!

19:20.909 --> 19:24.163
Hey, now. Quit pampering him, Petra.

19:24.580 --> 19:26.456
How did he even help?

19:26.665 --> 19:29.751
All he did was whine
like a pathetic little brat.

19:30.127 --> 19:33.422
I guess making it back alive
might be considered praiseworthy,

19:33.630 --> 19:36.758
but only after the mission is done
and over with.

19:37.384 --> 19:41.555
Just so you know, twerp, an expedition
isn't over until you're back home.

19:41.972 --> 19:44.141
Yes, I get it already!

19:46.852 --> 19:48.270
Oruo! Petra!

19:48.353 --> 19:50.772
For a couple of soldiers who cried
and pissed their pants

19:50.856 --> 19:51.815
during their first battle,

19:51.899 --> 19:53.233
you've really grown!

19:54.693 --> 19:55.777
Don't mention that!

19:55.861 --> 19:58.488
Are you trying
to make him lose respect for me, Eld?

19:58.572 --> 20:01.033
- Wow! She really did?
- It's the truth.

20:01.116 --> 20:03.577
And just so you know,
I never pissed myself, Eren.

20:03.660 --> 20:04.536
You idiot!

20:04.620 --> 20:07.414
I'll have you know
that I have the highest kill count!

20:07.497 --> 20:08.916
I'm the best, you moron!

20:08.999 --> 20:11.835
There's more to a soldier's merits
than just kill counts!

20:11.919 --> 20:13.503
Shut up, you idiot!

20:13.587 --> 20:16.298
Petra, does that mean it sprayed
everywhere in midair?

20:16.381 --> 20:17.549
Knock it off!

20:17.633 --> 20:19.384
Are you on a picnic or something?

20:19.468 --> 20:21.053
We're outside the Walls, you know!

20:21.386 --> 20:23.639
Also I never wet myself either, Eren!

20:34.066 --> 20:37.444
Oh, that must be a message
from Captain Levi.

20:37.861 --> 20:39.196
We're regrouping with the Captain!

20:39.279 --> 20:40.864
Stow the chatter until we're home!

21:02.135 --> 21:02.970
Erwin.

21:03.428 --> 21:05.347
Why did you have Levi
replenish his supplies

21:05.430 --> 21:06.598
when there is no time to waste?

21:07.266 --> 21:08.767
The Female Titan was eaten.

21:09.184 --> 21:11.895
But did you see
the person inside get eaten?

21:12.688 --> 21:13.814
I didn't.

21:14.856 --> 21:15.857
Are you saying...

21:15.941 --> 21:16.817
Yes.

21:16.900 --> 21:19.278
If, as you deduced earlier,

21:19.611 --> 21:23.323
we're dealing with a type that remains
able-bodied after de-transformation,

21:24.616 --> 21:28.620
and if they had equipped themselves with
omnidirectional mobility gear in advance,

21:30.330 --> 21:34.584
that means they are now wearing
one of our uniforms...

21:35.961 --> 21:37.254
Captain Levi?

21:38.463 --> 21:40.048
No. It's not!

21:40.132 --> 21:41.133
Who are you?

21:49.850 --> 21:51.184
Gunther!

21:51.393 --> 21:52.769
Hey! Why?

21:53.895 --> 21:54.896
Gunther!

22:03.697 --> 22:07.200
...and have blended in
with the rest of us, soldiers.

23:42.712 --> 23:44.881
The capture operation has failed.

23:45.465 --> 23:48.760
The Female Titan appears
before Eren once more.

23:49.136 --> 23:53.348
Standing in the way
is a team of Titan-killing experts,

23:53.682 --> 23:55.517
the Special Operations Squad.
